0:19.350">the </span><span begin="00:19.350" end="00:19.890">floor </span><span begin="00:19.890" end="00:20.310">with </span><span begin="00:20.310" end="00:20.820">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.820" end="00:28.200"><span begin="00:20.820" end="00:21.210">And </span><span begin="00:21.210" end="00:21.900">when </span><span begin="00:21.900" end="00:22.020">you </span><span begin="00:22.020" end="00:22.530">touch </span><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:22.980">my </span><span begin="00:22.980" end="00:24.240">hand' </span><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:24.510">I </span><span begin="00:24.510" end="00:24.690">go </span><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:26.070">crazy </span><span begin="00:26.070" end="00:28.200">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.230" end="00:31.410"><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.410">The </span><span begin="00:28.410" end="00:29.130">music </span><span begin="00:29.130" end="00:29.580">tells </span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.880">me </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:30.390">what </span><span begin="00:30.390" end="00:30.720">to </span><span begin="00:30.720" end="00:31.410">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.010" end="00:34.860"><span begin="00:32.010" end="00:32.460">Like </span><span begin="00:32.460" end="00:32.580">you </span><span begin="00:32.580" end="00:33.120">now </span><span begin="00:33.120" end="00:33.660">but' </span><span begin="00:33.660" end="00:34.080">is </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.440">it </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.860">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.860" end="00:38.010"><span begin="00:34.860" end="00:35.340">By </span><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.490">the </span><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:36.000">time </span><span begin="00:36.000" end="00:36.150">we </span><span begin="00:36.150" end="00:36.630">say </span><span begin="00:36.630" end="00:38.010">goodnight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.370" end="00:41.940"><spa