/span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:02.400">art</span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.400">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.400" end="01:05.130"><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.730">Cause' </span><span begin="01:02.730" end="01:02.850">the </span><span begin="01:02.850" end="01:03.150">way </span><span begin="01:03.150" end="01:03.300">your </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.600">got </span><span begin="01:03.600" end="01:03.720">you </span><span begin="01:03.720" end="01:04.410">body </span><span begin="01:04.410" end="01:05.130">moving'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.130" end="01:06.750"><span begin="01:05.130" end="01:05.280">It's </span><span begin="01:05.280" end="01:05.550">got </span><span begin="01:05.550" end="01:05.940">me </span><span begin="01:05.940" end="01:06.750">confused</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.750" end="01:09.570"><span begin="01:06.750" end="01:06.930">And' </span><span begin="01:06.930" end="01:07.080">I </span><span begin="01:07.080" end="01:07.320">can't </span><span begin="01:07.320" end="01:07.620">tell </span><span begin="01:07.620" end="01:07.800">if </span><span begin="01:07.800" end="01:08.010">it's </span><span begin="01:08.010" end="01:08.130">the </span><span begin="01:08.130" end="01:08.640">beat </span><span begin="01:08.640" end="01:08.790">or </span><span begin="01:08.790" end="01:09.570">sparks</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.190" end="01:13.890"><span begin="01:11.190" end="01:11.730">Who </span><span begin="01:11.730" end="01:12.180">owns </span><span begin="01:12.180" end="01:12.360">my </span><span begin="01:12.360" end="01:13.380">heart</span><span begin="01:13.380" end="01:13.890">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.890" end="01:16.740"><span begin="01:13.890" end="01:14.220">Is </span><span begin="01:14.220" end="01:14.340">it </span><span begin="01:14.340" end="01:14.790">love' </span><span begin="01:14.790" end="01:15.240">or </span><span begin="01:15.240